Note that $\sum_{1\le x_1<x_3 \le P}\tau^3(x_3^2-x_1^2)\le
\sum_{1\le a,b\le 2P}\tau^3(a)\tau^3(b)$. The desired result
follows from above easily.
\end{proof}
